   Certain monster types can't become tame, because they replace the
"edog" structure with something else --- "eshk" for shopkeepers, "epri" 
for priests, "emin" for minions, and so on. Angels are one of the
untameable creatures (except for guardian angels, who are un-untameable).
You should see similar behavior wishing for a tame shopkeeper.

   I don't know why "human zombie" is the wizmode behavior, but I'm sure it 
would be easy enough to sourcedive and find out whether it was giving you 
a random monster, or what.

